          "width": 408,
          "height": 490,
          "credit": "Image supplied in the LM-5 package"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Who Built Me?",
      "text": "I wasn't built by one team alone! Grumman led my creation, while brilliant teams across America built the engines, controls, and life-support systems that made my journey possible!",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-1-2-1",
          "src": "https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/624073main_1969-04-04_full.jpg",
          "sourceUrl": "https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/624073main_1969-04-04_full.jpg",
