          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTOpr4FDvXkJnARF6G4pv-gS3Y1J1WcqBqdDJ8L-7gx4g&s=10",
          "sourceUrl": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTOpr4FDvXkJnARF6G4pv-gS3Y1J1WcqBqdDJ8L-7gx4g&s=10",
          "title": "Lunar module construction reference",
          "caption": "Lunar module construction reference.",
          "alt": "Lunar module construction reference",
          "width": 436,
          "height": 458,
          "credit": "Image supplied in the LM-5 package"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Why Was I Created?",
      "text": "I was born for one extraordinary mission: to carry Astronauts to the Moon, help them explore its mysteries, and bring them safely home. One half stayed behind; the other carried them onward.",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-1-3-1",
          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT505-VINMsVJEg0dZpoS8vGiQ_B6fVDsog_y3yTqB9SA&s",
          "sourceUrl": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT505-VINMsVJEg0dZpoS8vGiQ_B6fVDsog_y3yTqB9SA&s",
          "title": "Eagle’s two-stage mission",
          "caption": "Eagle’s two-stage mission.",
          "alt": "Eagle’s two-stage mission",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 168,
          "credit": "Image supplied in the LM-5 package"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Inside My Cabin",
      "text": "Inside me, two astronauts shared a compact cabin, surrounded by windows, switches and instruments. I became their shelter on the Moon—even their brief rest took place within my walls.",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-1-4-1",
          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRRUDXpRmtkaJRoaOp38ozrQ9ChYwfjFU0eTHIxeoxJ1mmILesE7pma6z-T&s=10",
