    {
      "title": "Alone Above the Moon",
      "text": "The Moon was finally close. On July 20, I separated from Columbia. Michael Collins stayed behind in orbit, while Buzz and Neil prepared to take me down.",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-2-2-1",
          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRkt1Cff_jqcNrAYlUP1FFHZnxaFSDnSKEEcbEIJjKhpoEUoCw_VEmuZZR2&s=10",
          "sourceUrl": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRkt1Cff_jqcNrAYlUP1FFHZnxaFSDnSKEEcbEIJjKhpoEUoCw_VEmuZZR2&s=10",
          "title": "Eagle separates from Columbia",
          "caption": "Eagle separates from Columbia.",
          "alt": "Eagle separates from Columbia",
          "width": 510,
          "height": 392,
          "credit": "Image supplied in the LM-5 package"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Moon Is Finally Mine",
      "text": "Alarms sounded during my descent, but the mission continued. Neil took manual control, guiding me past dangerous terrain. Then, at last, I touched the lunar surface. The Eagle had landed!",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-2-3-1",
          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSvXdkW8CsHAdtQEkWB65mEUtvY3qZd9b3YZOtv-3dfBQ&s=10",
