    {
      "title": "A Gift for Science",
      "text": "I didn't bring only astronauts to the Moon. I also carried a little instrument called the LRRR. Buzz Aldrin deployed it on the lunar surface, leaving behind a gift for science. Want to know what happened to my little companion? You can discover its story next!",
      "gallery": [
        {
          "id": "lm5-3-3-1",
          "src": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSVzGqm85mCXZvl9APycpWff-SyOHJ0eDal9ts9w8bFAA&s=10",
