        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Why I Still Matter",
      "text": "My lower half still rests on the Moon, a reminder of where humanity first stepped onto another world. I showed us what was possible. And today, I hope young explorers will dream even further. My journey ended, but humanity's journey is only beginning.",
